# Commit phase of a PREPARED transaction: redo files already durable.
# Preparation/commit-marker creation is outside this scenario's scope.
# Recovery rolls forward any remaining redo file, including at cut zero.
persistscope 1
initial left old
initial right old
initial redo-left new
initial redo-right new
run
rename redo-left left
rename redo-right right
sync_dir
ack
recover
rename_if_exists redo-left left
rename_if_exists redo-right right
check
equal left right
expect left new
expect_after_ack right new
